// Title: Process Monitor Driver Creation By Non-Sysinternals Binary
// Rule ID: a05baa88-e922-4001-bc4d-8738135f27de
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1068
// Category: file_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_sysinternals_procmon_driver_susp_creation.yml
